00:01:27.359 --> 00:01:32.619
A California judge ruled Tesla liable for fraud and negligent misrepresentation, grit

00:01:32.619 --> 00:01:37.779
daily news found, after the company misrepeated discovery deadlines in a solar roof case.

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:43.899
The homeowner, Ambrose Conroy of Rancho Santa Fe, signed a contract in March 2020 for

00:01:43.899 --> 00:01:48.119
a 13.1 kilowatt system priced at $82,210.

00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:55.119
The project later grew to an 18.2 kilowatt roof and six power walls for about $110,000

00:01:55.119 --> 00:01:56.619
by February 2021.

00:01:57.459 --> 00:02:01.999
The roof was never completed, failed county inspection, and never produced electricity,

00:02:02.459 --> 00:02:06.839
and Tesla had already admitted breach of contract, breach of warranty, and negligence.

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:12.259
Judge Cynthia Freeland sanctioned the company twice for discovery failures, ordering payments

00:02:12.259 --> 00:02:21.439
of $15,467.50 in February, and $13,500 in June. The missing material included Microsoft

00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:27.479
team's messages, occupational safety and health administration, or OSHA logs, emails with

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:33.079
San Diego County inspectors, and more than 20 quality and safety reports from Tesla's internal

00:02:33.079 --> 00:02:39.259
Bolt system, and the October 27th ruling limits the remaining trial to compensatory and punitive

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:47.935
of damages. The Robotaxi app in version 26.11.0, Tesla Roddy wrote, now shows estimated arrival

00:02:47.935 --> 00:02:53.795
times, wait times, availability and fares for both CyberCab and Model Y on one screen.

00:02:54.655 --> 00:02:58.935
Riders can compare those figures before booking instead of choosing a vehicle type first.

00:02:59.515 --> 00:03:04.115
The build follows earlier ones that added seating capacity indicators and quiet mode.

00:03:04.115 --> 00:03:12.502
The Tesla iOS app 4.62.5, TSL aiming noted, adds a driver's license scan that captures

00:03:12.502 --> 00:03:18.102
both sides and extracts details for registration, with a prompt to retry if the scan fails.

00:03:18.662 --> 00:03:24.042
It separates bought and human advisor messages in support chats and adds attachment, voice,

00:03:24.382 --> 00:03:27.682
and feedback controls so the full conversation stays in one thread.

00:03:28.342 --> 00:03:33.202
The app now checks whether a car still recognizes a phone key before clearing a drop Bluetooth

00:03:33.202 --> 00:03:35.982
pairing, avoiding unnecessary resets.

00:03:36.502 --> 00:03:38.502
It also confirms smart breaker commands

00:03:38.502 --> 00:03:41.882
and displays power flow among solar, battery, grid,

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.382
home, and vehicle.

00:03:44.002 --> 00:03:46.822
Code was added to request shop returns with attachments,

00:03:47.542 --> 00:03:50.702
submit trade-in requests, locate nearby service centers,

00:03:50.982 --> 00:03:53.382
and pull up next steps for energy support cases.

00:03:54.368 --> 00:03:57.048
Guyway launched a ride-hailing service in Guyana.

00:03:57.428 --> 00:04:00.948
The Guyana Chronicle said, using 52 Tesla vehicles,

00:04:00.948 --> 00:04:05.788
The operator intends to expand that fleet by more than 100 additional Teslas

00:04:05.788 --> 00:04:11.790
in the coming months. The first cars are already serving local customers. Tesla has asked

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:16.150
to run driverless vehicle trials on Australian roads starting in 2027.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:23.190
ZECR reported. The filing seeks approval for unsupervised operations on public roads. Visitors

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:29.650
at AutoZeric 2026 inspected a Tesla CyberCab with its butterfly doors raised. Top electric

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:33.910
SUV reported, including the interior and the door mechanism up close.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:39.790
The two-seat robotaxi remains in the demonstration phase, with no customer deliveries announced.

00:04:40.932 --> 00:04:47.392
A Tesla Model Y finished a 617-kilometer European road trip for 59 euros and 53 cents.

00:04:47.872 --> 00:04:49.072
Tech Insider recorded.

00:04:49.712 --> 00:04:53.412
The journey used a mix of public superchargers and destination chargers.

00:04:54.032 --> 00:04:57.172
Efficiency was logged under mixed highway and urban conditions.

00:04:57.172 --> 00:05:03.183
actions. What car magazine compared the new Tesla Model Y against the Mercedes-GLB electric

00:05:03.183 --> 00:05:08.863
on range, charging speed, interior space, and pricing? The test highlighted differences

00:05:08.863 --> 00:05:14.363
in real-world efficiency and build quality between the two electric SUVs. No winner was

00:05:14.363 --> 00:05:21.574
declared in the initial report. The Yang-Wang U9 Extreme reached 503.17 on public roads

00:05:21.574 --> 00:05:28.414
in Abu Dhabi, TSL Aming reported, with verification from the Federation International Delautomobile,

00:05:28.994 --> 00:05:33.794
or FIA, and Guinness recognition as the highest one-way speed by a production car.

00:05:34.474 --> 00:05:40.134
On October 31st, the car reached only 490. Engineers then steepen the rear wing,

00:05:40.454 --> 00:05:45.454
retune suspension rebound, and adjusted tire pressures before the record run the next day.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:50.710
Tesla outlined updates to its accelerator road map, including the sixth generation

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:57.990
an SI6 chip and Dojo D3 according to 403D. Air resistance scales with the cube of speed,

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:03.290
so the power required to add the last 20 can exceed what was needed to reach 450 in

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:10.770
the first place. The U9 extreme needed 4 motors of 744 horsepower each, a 1200 volt architecture,

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:17.990
and tires rated above 500 just to push from 498.6 to that record. That last stretch took

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:22.430
4.5 seconds of full power after the car had already covered most of the run.

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:29.210
Those motors spin at 30,000 RPM and draw from lithium-iron phosphate, or LFP, cells that

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.610
can discharge at 30C.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:39.210
The pack can still deliver 2,414 horsepower at 20% charge, and the 4 motors total 2,977

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:39.830
horsepower.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:46.770
Dysus X active suspension can apply 50 kN of force in 120 milliseconds, while adjusting

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:51.670
costing power to each wheel more than 100 times per second, which becomes mandatory once

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:58.050
the car has to stay planted at maximum output. Custom semi-slick tires from GeedyGrip 38%

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:03.470
better than prior compounds, and battery cooling and tire compounds still have to survive repeated

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:06.650
runs at those loads without degradation that would end the attempt.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:13.130
The same constraints apply to any manufacturer targeting 530 or beyond. Before the record

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:20.130
run, a test car lost traction at 420-450 in China and hit guardrails, showing that keeping

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.630
the car straight matters as much as raw power.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.930
The 1200-volt system reduces current and heat compared with the 400-volt architecture

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:33.510
common in most Teslas, while a two-layer cooling structure keeps the LFP pack from overheating

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.130
even at full discharge rates.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:40.550
Teslas Roadster program has already stated a 531-go for a future variant.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:46.410
Reaching it will take the same layered solutions, higher voltage, faster motors, active chassis

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:52.190
control, and tires that hold grip above 500, while still delivering usable range and everyday

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.070
driveability.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:58.950
Each added system increases cost, mass, and complexity, which cuts into the margin available

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.570
once the car reaches production.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:05.550
Extra downforce from a steeper wing also increases drag that must be overcome.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:10.970
Tesla's vertical integration in motors, batteries, and software may help control some of those

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:16.090
costs, yet the physics of air resistance remains unchanged regardless of who builds the car.

